    "about": {
        "title": "About this guide",
        "whatIsIt": "What it is",
        "whatIsItBody": "A quick guide to Age of Empires II units: what they cost, who they beat, which upgrades change their numbers and how many villagers it takes to build them without stopping.",
        "howCounters": "How counters are calculated",
        "howCountersBody": "Every matchup runs the game's damage formula: for each shared armour class, the attacker's attack minus the defender's armour, summed, with a floor of 1 damage. Hits to kill, time to kill and damage per second follow from there. Trade efficiency compares how much value each side destroys per second.",
        "limitations": "Limitations",
        "limitationsBody": "The simulation is one unit against one unit. It does not model mass battles, focus fire, splash damage over groups, conversions or perfect micro. Read it next to the official in-game summary.",
        "dataSource": "Data",
        "dataSourceBody": "Stats, texts and icons are extracted from the game data itself and versioned alongside the app, which runs entirely offline.",
        "credits": "Credits",
        "creditsBody": "Age of Empires II and all its icons belong to Microsoft, Forgotten Empires, Ensemble Studios and SkyBox Labs. This is a fan project with no official affiliation.",
        "language": "Language"
    },
